# Fixture affix file for spell_kit tests: explicit BREAK patterns, including the anchored forms
# (^p strips a leading occurrence, p$ a trailing one), contrasting with test/fixtures/basic, which
# declares no BREAK at all and so falls back to hunspell's default.
SET UTF-8
TRY box

BREAK 2
BREAK ^x
BREAK x$
